target: not aarch64 -- speed numbers are INDICATIVE ONLY (see the caveat in this file's header)
sizeof(void*) = 8; a 32-bit host would synthesise every uint64_t operation and answer a different question.
The decision rule is in this file's header, written before measuring (EXPERIMENTS.md).

